DGE\" shirt, one black \"EDGE\" shirt). Analyzing auditory elements: continuous high-pitched engine roar with Doppler effect and crowd murmur. Noting visual-audio alignment: engine sound indicates a vehicle in motion on the track, while visuals show stationary equipment and people observing. Confirming no contradictory elements: engine noise corresponds to track activity, not the stationary tractor. Final synthesis: A\n\n\\boxed{A man in an orange safety vest sweeps near a white IBC tank while two individuals in branded shirts stand observing with a green tractor and crowd on a grassy slope in the background amid continuous engine roar and crowd murmur.}", "time_sec": 188.691, "generation_time_seconds": 138.3896, "selection_time_seconds": 45.7582, "nemotron": {"method": "tot", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "n_vote": 2, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
