{"id": "70", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of whooshing and humming fills the air as a man speaks, accompanied by distant squeaks, while young men play basketball on the court, with a logo-adorned speaker nearby.", "pred": "\\boxed{Young man in black jersey with medal speaks in gym; audio features male voice identifying as Adam Gilbert from Dallas, Texas, watching Texas television.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Young man in black jersey with medal speaks in gym; audio features male voice identifying as Adam Gilbert from Dallas, Texas, watching Texas television.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video opens with a \"rivals YAHOO! SPORTS\" logo on a metallic background accompanied by a loud engine sound, then transitions to a \"TEXAS HOOPS TELEVISION\" graphic featuring a basketball breaking through a screen with an old TV aesthetic, followed by a young man in a basketball jersey with a medal speaking in a gym, while the audio shifts to a male voice introducing himself as Adam Gilbert from Dallas, Texas, watching Texas television.\n\\boxed{Black screen with engine rumble, metallic \"rivals YAHOO! SPORTS\" logo, \"TEXAS HOOPS TELEVISION\" graphic with basketball breaking TV screen, young man in jersey with medal speaking in gym, male voice identifies as Adam Gilbert from Dallas, Texas, watching Texas television.}\nThe video shows a young man in a black jersey with blue and white trim and a red, white, and blue medal speaking directly to the camera in a gym with blue and white walls, while audio features a male voice introducing himself as Adam Gilbert from Dallas, Texas, watching Texas television.\n\n\\boxed{Young man in black jersey with medal speaks in gym; audio features male voice identifying as Adam Gilbert from Dallas, Texas, watching Texas television.}", "time_sec": 226.95, "generation_time_seconds": 168.4224, "selection_time_seconds": 55.2302, "nemotron": {"method": "tot", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "n_vote": 2, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
